1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:03,040
Oj! Spaden då?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,360
Leoparden vet inte var.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,310
Kan du hjälpa leoparden?

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,440
Kan du se var spaden är?

5
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,540
Ja, där!

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,280
Ja, bakom hinken!

7
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:28,280
Klapp-klapp, sandkaka.

8
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:34,580
Oj! Tre sandkakor!

